{"_meta":{"fastmcp":{"tags":["Positions","jobmojito","jobmojito-api"]},"jobmojito":{"category":"Positions","http_method":"POST"}},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Change a position step's settings"},"description":"[Positions] Change one step's settings. It takes `step_id`, optionally `name`, `advance` and `kombo`, and only the settings object of the step's type (`meeting`, `certo`, `external_assessment`, `interview`, `pre_screening`); only the keys you send change and null removes a key, but a list you send (pre_screening form_fields, assessment_rules) replaces the whole list: every item to keep is in it. pre_screening id and status are read only. A new form field: {\"id\": \"custom_<timestamp>\", \"title\", \"field_type\": text|file|radio, \"type\": required|optional, \"options\": [\"Yes\", \"No\"] for radio}; it goes after the fields get_interview_definition include=process returns. pre_screening all_rules_fulfilled_auto_approve approves a candidate who meets every rule without review; whether they then move on by themselves is `advance` (auto), a separate setting. expected_updated_at takes the step's `updated_at` from get_interview_definition include=process; when the step changed since, the call is refused with 409. Settings are live: candidates already on the step get them at once. dry_run=true shows the changed keys, the candidates on the step, booked meetings and warnings, and saves nothing. Nobody is e-mailed. A new meeting duration applies to slots created afterwards; existing slots keep theirs (manage_meeting_slot changes them).\n\nEvery argument in full, with examples: get_tool_reference.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"advance":{"description":"auto: a candidate who passes moves on by themselves; manual: a recruiter moves them on. null = auto.","enum":["auto","manual",null],"type":["string","null"]},"certo":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Settings of a certo.bio verification step.","properties":{"include_contact":{"type":"boolean"},"scope_types":{"items":{"enum":["employment","education","certification","role","language","right_to_work"],"type":"string"},"minItems":1,"type":["array","null"]},"wait_for_identity":{"type":"boolean"}},"type":"object"},"conversation_id":{"description":"The conversation_id this server returned earlier in this conversation, unchanged, including after later user messages. Omit it if you have none. Recorded for the server developer's analytics.","type":"string"},"dry_run":{"default":false,"description":"true: validate and answer what would change and whom it reaches, without writing anything.","type":"boolean"},"expected_updated_at":{"description":"The step's updated_at as you read it (get_interview_definition with include=process, or an earlier answer of this call). When the step changed since, nothing is written and the answer is 409; a new read gives the current value. null or left out: not checked.","format":"date-time","type":["string","null"]},"external_assessment":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Settings of an external assessment step (the external_assessment feature).","properties":{"due_days":{"maximum":60.0,"minimum":1.0,"type":"integer"},"instructions":{"maxLength":3000,"type":["string","null"]},"pass_score":{"type":["number","null"]},"provider_id":{"format":"uuid","type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"interview":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Settings of an AI interview step.","properties":{"allow_human_interview":{"type":"boolean"}},"type":"object"},"kombo":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Mapping of this step to the connected ATS (Kombo).","properties":{"accept_stage_id":{"maxLength":200,"type":["string","null"]},"reject_reason_ai_id":{"maxLength":200,"type":["string","null"]},"reject_reason_id":{"maxLength":200,"type":["string","null"]}},"type":"object"},"llm_model":{"description":"Your model id, e.g. \"claude-opus-4-8\"; \"unknown\" if unsure. For analytics.","type":"string"},"meeting":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Settings of a meeting step. Each key is merged separately; keys left out keep their value.","properties":{"conference_provider":{"enum":["in_person","fixed","zoom","teams","meet",null],"type":["string","null"]},"data_collection":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"mode":{"enum":["none","form","text"],"type":"string"},"taxonomy_id":{"format":"uuid","type":["string","null"]}},"required":["mode"],"type":["object","null"]},"duration_minutes":{"maximum":1440.0,"minimum":5.0,"type":["integer","null"]},"email_variant":{"maxLength":100,"type":["string","null"]},"horizon_days":{"maximum":365.0,"minimum":1.0,"type":["integer","null"]},"instructions":{"maxLength":4000,"type":["string","null"]},"interviewer_profile_ids":{"items":{"format":"uuid","type":"string"},"maxItems":50,"type":["array","null"]},"location":{"maxLength":500,"type":["string","null"]},"meeting_url":{"maxLength":2000,"pattern":"^https?:\\/\\/\\S+$","type":["string","null"]},"min_notice_hours":{"maximum":720.0,"minimum":0.0,"type":["integer","null"]},"mode":{"enum":["slots","availability",null],"type":["string","null"]},"nudge_after_days":{"maximum":365.0,"minimum":0.0,"type":["integer","null"]},"panel_profile_ids":{"items":{"format":"uuid","type":"string"},"maxItems":8,"minItems":2,"type":["array","null"]},"reschedule_cutoff_hours":{"maximum":8760.0,"minimum":0.0,"type":["integer","null"]},"slot_interval_minutes":{"maximum":240.0,"minimum":5.0,"type":["integer","null"]}},"type":"object"},"name":{"description":"New name of the step. null or empty removes the name (the type's default label is shown); left out keeps it.","maxLength":300,"type":["string","null"]},"pre_screening":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Pre-screening steps: the settings to change, as include=process returns them; that object can be sent back as it is.","properties":{"all_rules_fulfilled_auto_approve":{"type":"boolean"},"assessment_rules":{